WEBVTT

00:00:11.330 --> 00:00:14.290
I...! I...

00:00:14.290 --> 00:00:17.000
I wanna chase Mineko!

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:18.700
Mineko?

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.700
Who's that?

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:23.500
I wanna try talking to her again...

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:25.500
...because I wanna be friends!

00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:29.410
Right!

00:00:53.870 --> 00:00:56.660
<i>Let's dive right into today's letters</i>

00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:02.160
<i>It's "Personal Advice" and the title is</i>

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.160
<i>"Hurry into Love! Hurry Love! Love!!"</i>

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:18.790
<i>Hey, hear me out.</i>
<i>There's something I really wanna say</i>

00:01:18.790 --> 00:01:24.000
<i>You've got courage to follow</i>
<i>your dreams which is why I chose you</i>

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:26.120
<i>Is it a risky bet</i>

00:01:26.120 --> 00:01:31.580
<i>Despite no experience,</i>
<i>we jumped right in together</i>

00:01:31.580 --> 00:01:35.040
<i>And this unpredictable story</i>

00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:41.120
<i>Is your creation--</i>
<i>a heart-throbbing innovation</i>

00:01:41.120 --> 00:01:43.580
<i>Quickly! Quickly! Take me along</i>

00:01:43.580 --> 00:01:46.200
<i>On a bittersweet love venture</i>

00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:51.000
<i>Ah! Measured not by skill</i>
<i>but by scale and romance</i>

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:56.080
<i>Hurry! Hurry! Boldly, subtly, show your appeal</i>

00:01:56.080 --> 00:02:01.120
<i>Ah! Our meeting was a miracle</i>
<i>that can't be neglected</i>

00:02:01.120 --> 00:02:04.700
<i>It's galactic level</i>

00:02:05.370 --> 00:02:08.200
<i>I see. Sounds like you're head over heels.</i>

00:02:10.200 --> 00:02:13.500
<i>Let's tell him, just like battle</i>

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:15.870
<i>"Hurry into Love! Hurry Love! Love!!"</i>

00:02:15.870 --> 00:02:18.250
<i>Everyone, Hurry! Hurry Love! Love!!</i>

00:02:19.250 --> 00:02:22.790
"Episode Nine: Knight in Shining Armor"

00:02:22.790 --> 00:02:24.540
Really?

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:26.910
You talked with the one famnela?

00:02:26.910 --> 00:02:30.620
Yeah. And she said her name was Mineko.

00:02:30.620 --> 00:02:35.700
A maju with a name?
And she even called herself that?

00:02:35.700 --> 00:02:40.700
I heard her say it myself.
Her name's Mineko all right.

00:02:40.700 --> 00:02:42.080
Huh?

00:02:42.080 --> 00:02:45.410
Mineko was fine with how it was before.

00:02:48.330 --> 00:02:50.700
I wanna become friends with her.

00:02:50.700 --> 00:02:54.500
No, I promised her we'd be friends.

00:02:54.500 --> 00:02:58.750
President, you met this
talking famnela too, right?

00:02:58.750 --> 00:03:01.040
Do you think we should find her?

00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:07.290
It's not just that she can talk.
She looks different than other famnela too.

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:12.250
If it's from a mutation,
there must be a reason for it.

00:03:14.450 --> 00:03:18.330
Who knows? Maybe she's like that weird dungeon.

00:03:18.330 --> 00:03:20.160
Distorted by the Big Gate?

00:03:20.160 --> 00:03:21.330
Yeah.

00:03:21.330 --> 00:03:26.910
I don't know for sure, but it all might
tie into my dad's whereabouts.

00:03:26.910 --> 00:03:31.500
In short, she's precious
to the company and Makoto too.

00:03:31.500 --> 00:03:34.040
I'd say she checks all the boxes!

00:03:35.410 --> 00:03:38.040
I-I wouldn't say precious!

00:03:38.040 --> 00:03:41.160
What's this? Embarrassed already?

00:03:41.160 --> 00:03:44.660
We all might've been getting along by now.

00:03:46.830 --> 00:03:50.410
That is, if someone hadn't interfered.

00:03:50.410 --> 00:03:52.500
Yeah. Agreed.

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:56.250
What kind of fool would do something like that?

00:03:58.750 --> 00:03:59.790
What?

00:04:03.660 --> 00:04:06.660
Why?! Why do I have to search too?!

00:04:06.660 --> 00:04:08.000
Quit whining!

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:09.080
R-Right.

00:04:10.950 --> 00:04:14.540
Hmm... Which way to go?

00:04:14.540 --> 00:04:18.540
What now? Too bad she didn't leave footprints.

00:04:23.120 --> 00:04:24.790
Sh-Shoot!

00:04:24.790 --> 00:04:25.830
President!

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:29.250
Don't move! They'll notice us!

00:04:29.250 --> 00:04:30.330
R-Right!

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:34.830
There's just two of 'em.

00:04:34.830 --> 00:04:36.830
Did they leave the herd?

00:04:36.830 --> 00:04:38.830
Great! Leave this to me!

00:04:38.830 --> 00:04:41.160
Hold your horses!

00:04:41.160 --> 00:04:44.540
And here my foot just healed!

00:04:44.540 --> 00:04:45.910
Hmph!

00:04:45.910 --> 00:04:50.250
Since they haven't noticed us,
there's no need to fight.

00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:52.410
They're taking shiny things.

00:04:52.410 --> 00:04:55.660
Famnela love anything that sparkles.

00:04:55.660 --> 00:05:00.450
They always carry jewels and gems
back to their den.

00:05:00.450 --> 00:05:05.790
In other words, if we follow those famnela,
we can find their den.

00:05:05.790 --> 00:05:08.540
They'll take us straight to Mineko.

00:05:08.540 --> 00:05:09.540
Yeah...

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:11.700
Probably.

00:05:17.160 --> 00:05:20.000
Come on. Let's try not to lose 'em.

00:05:23.040 --> 00:05:24.120
Makoto...

00:05:33.120 --> 00:05:35.540
Makoto, you okay?

00:05:35.540 --> 00:05:36.370
Yeah.

00:05:36.370 --> 00:05:41.790
If something's wrong, tell me.
I'm worried about Mineko too.

00:05:41.790 --> 00:05:44.290
Mineko was hurt, remember?

00:05:45.700 --> 00:05:48.660
Yeah. That was a nasty gash.

00:05:50.540 --> 00:05:53.620
That wound was made by a claw.

00:05:53.620 --> 00:05:57.290
A claw? You think they would do that?

00:05:57.290 --> 00:05:58.580
Maybe.

00:05:58.580 --> 00:06:00.660
Hey! What's going on here?!

00:06:00.660 --> 00:06:03.750
Yeah! You guys owe us an explanation!

00:06:07.950 --> 00:06:12.370
Well, I think Mineko is being
bullied by the other famnela.

00:06:12.370 --> 00:06:13.580
Huh?

00:06:13.580 --> 00:06:16.500
And to the extent of hurting her.

00:06:16.500 --> 00:06:19.450
Why would they be so cruel?

00:06:19.450 --> 00:06:24.250
I don't know if it's true or not,
but that's why I need to find her.

00:06:24.250 --> 00:06:27.700
If the bullying escalates any worse...

00:06:27.700 --> 00:06:29.910
I think we should hurry.

00:06:29.910 --> 00:06:32.120
Yeah. Let's find her fast.

00:06:41.700 --> 00:06:43.870
This must be the herd's den.

00:06:43.870 --> 00:06:46.330
Where's this Mineko we're looking for?

00:06:48.290 --> 00:06:50.410
There! In the corner!

00:06:51.410 --> 00:06:52.830
It's Mineko...

00:07:00.080 --> 00:07:03.790
Those famnela are attacking their own kind!

00:07:03.790 --> 00:07:06.950
I knew it! They're rejecting her!

00:07:06.950 --> 00:07:09.750
I-I wonder what their reason is.

00:07:09.750 --> 00:07:14.200
I'm guessing it's because
she's different from the others.

00:07:14.200 --> 00:07:18.000
But no matter the reason, I won't stand for it.

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:20.450
Let's help her, President!

00:07:20.450 --> 00:07:21.750
Right!

00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:23.660
All right! Let's do this!

00:07:23.660 --> 00:07:25.700
It's time for fire magic!

00:07:25.700 --> 00:07:26.950
Wait!

00:07:26.950 --> 00:07:31.200
It's dangerous to face this many.
Plus, we're in their den.

00:07:31.200 --> 00:07:33.620
They're not just gonna run away.

00:07:33.620 --> 00:07:35.290
Then, what do we do?

00:07:36.330 --> 00:07:39.790
I do have one idea, but...

00:07:39.790 --> 00:07:40.790
Huh?

00:07:42.500 --> 00:07:45.080
Wh-What's that face for?

00:07:48.540 --> 00:07:50.080
This ends now!

00:07:52.910 --> 00:07:55.410
I'm the great Rivar of Cyedge!

00:07:55.410 --> 00:07:59.870
I'm outnumbered and I don't care!
Come on, bring it on!

00:08:01.950 --> 00:08:02.950
Huh?

00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:10.120
I-I know I said I don't care,
but isn't this overkill?

00:08:18.080 --> 00:08:20.660
Shit! How'd I get talked into this?!

00:08:22.870 --> 00:08:26.450
Yeah, this way! H-Hey, follow me!

00:08:30.580 --> 00:08:33.040
C'mon! C'mon! I've got more!

00:08:39.790 --> 00:08:43.000
I-I wonder if Rivar will be okay?

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:48.330
Well, Famnela love shiny things
and Rivar's pretty durable.

00:08:48.330 --> 00:08:51.290
Luckily, he has lots of change.

00:08:51.290 --> 00:08:57.410
It's his fault Mineko ran away.
We might as well make use of him.

00:08:57.410 --> 00:08:58.790
Mineko!

00:08:58.790 --> 00:09:02.870
Do you know who I am?
You showed me the way earlier.

00:09:07.410 --> 00:09:11.910
I guess not. You probably don't
recognize human faces.

00:09:13.830 --> 00:09:15.410
I know.

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:18.830
Makoto... I know.

00:09:18.830 --> 00:09:20.080
Mineko!

00:09:21.410 --> 00:09:22.620
Stay back.

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:23.790
Huh?

00:09:23.790 --> 00:09:28.790
I know Makoto isn't bad person, but...

00:09:28.790 --> 00:09:36.410
Scared of humans. When Mineko talks,
they try to capture me.

00:09:36.410 --> 00:09:40.700
The pack bullies Mineko too.

00:09:40.700 --> 00:09:46.160
When I use human words,
they disgusted with me...

00:09:46.160 --> 00:09:48.330
...and claw at me.

00:09:52.120 --> 00:09:53.330
Mineko is...

00:09:54.910 --> 00:09:56.120
...alone.

00:09:57.410 --> 00:10:00.160
In that case, why don't you join us?

00:10:00.160 --> 00:10:01.250
Huh?

00:10:01.250 --> 00:10:02.040
What?

00:10:02.040 --> 00:10:03.290
W-Wait up!

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:04.330
Makoto...

00:10:06.580 --> 00:10:10.250
I don't think there's any good in staying here.

00:10:10.250 --> 00:10:14.750
If it's so bad for you, why even stick around?

00:10:14.750 --> 00:10:19.750
Become an adventurer like us!
Work for Kibou Company!

00:10:19.750 --> 00:10:21.620
Makoto! You can't just--

00:10:21.620 --> 00:10:23.200
Wait, Akari.

00:10:23.200 --> 00:10:24.950
President?

00:10:24.950 --> 00:10:26.830
Makoto...

00:10:26.830 --> 00:10:32.700
Even if she can talk, she's still a maju.
Do you understand?

00:10:32.700 --> 00:10:35.200
Yeah. I understand.

00:10:35.200 --> 00:10:39.910
But even if we're different species,
we can still see eye-to-eye.

00:10:41.040 --> 00:10:42.080
Makoto...

00:10:43.540 --> 00:10:46.620
Okay. Then I'm fine with it.

00:10:46.620 --> 00:10:50.330
I think Mineko should join us too.

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:52.410
How about you guys?

00:10:52.410 --> 00:10:54.500
I dunno what to say.

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:56.540
I guess it's fine.

00:10:56.540 --> 00:10:58.040
I suppose...

00:10:59.410 --> 00:11:01.750
Guys!

00:11:01.750 --> 00:11:04.910
Mineko, an adventurer?

00:11:04.910 --> 00:11:11.660
Yup, with us.
Will you be an employee of Kibou Company?

00:11:11.660 --> 00:11:12.700
I will.

00:11:12.700 --> 00:11:14.790
Mineko!

00:11:14.790 --> 00:11:17.750
Mineko become adventurer.

00:11:18.700 --> 00:11:21.290
Together... with Makoto!

00:11:40.290 --> 00:11:45.040
Shoo! Shoo! Stay back!
I don't got any more coins! Go away!

00:11:48.620 --> 00:11:52.290
Wonderful... At this rate, I'll never leave.

00:11:52.290 --> 00:11:54.450
What are those guys doing?!

00:11:58.870 --> 00:12:00.620
Is that a famnela?

00:12:00.620 --> 00:12:02.750
If it is, it's a big one!

00:12:02.750 --> 00:12:04.950
Th-That maju is...!

00:12:04.950 --> 00:12:06.620
Famnela Queen!

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:10.290
Queen?! What's that?!

00:12:10.290 --> 00:12:13.700
It's the queen famnela that leads the herd!

00:12:13.700 --> 00:12:20.450
It's way tougher than the others,
plus it's bad news if you're under five stars!

00:12:20.450 --> 00:12:23.700
The highest of us only has four stars!

00:12:23.700 --> 00:12:27.120
If you need five to beat it, we're doomed!

00:12:27.120 --> 00:12:29.200
What now, President?!

00:12:29.200 --> 00:12:32.620
F-For now, let's take Mineko and run!

00:12:32.620 --> 00:12:35.500
Throw shiny stuff like we showed Rivar!

00:12:42.750 --> 00:12:44.250
Wh-What?!

00:12:44.250 --> 00:12:46.580
That didn't work at all!

00:12:46.580 --> 00:12:52.540
Its instinct to preserve the herd beats
its urge to collect shiny stuff!

00:12:52.540 --> 00:12:56.250
That's why it's furious at Mineko
for trying to leave!

00:13:00.750 --> 00:13:03.580
At this rate, we'll have to scare it off!

00:13:03.580 --> 00:13:07.200
Akari and Marika, attack!
Yutoria and Makoto, support!

00:13:07.200 --> 00:13:09.450
Wait!

00:13:09.450 --> 00:13:11.160
I'll handle this.

00:13:11.160 --> 00:13:13.620
No... Mineko and I.

00:13:13.620 --> 00:13:15.000
Huh?

00:13:15.000 --> 00:13:18.580
Didn't we decide we're in this together?

00:13:18.580 --> 00:13:20.410
Right, Mineko?

00:13:25.660 --> 00:13:26.660
Yeah!

00:13:27.500 --> 00:13:29.500
Makoto...

00:13:29.500 --> 00:13:31.790
Bring it on, Queen!

00:13:31.790 --> 00:13:34.660
Sorry, but Mineko isn't staying here!

00:13:34.660 --> 00:13:36.200
Deal with it!

00:13:39.830 --> 00:13:42.250
Makoto!

00:13:42.250 --> 00:13:44.040
I-I'm fine!

00:13:49.540 --> 00:13:51.830
Makoto! What are you doing?!

00:13:51.830 --> 00:13:53.580
That's...!

00:13:53.580 --> 00:13:55.790
Rate Heal!

00:13:59.330 --> 00:14:00.950
Healing magic?!

00:14:00.950 --> 00:14:04.370
Wh-Why does he want to help the enemy?

00:14:04.370 --> 00:14:08.660
No, he's not! Famnela are undead-type maju!

00:14:08.660 --> 00:14:12.200
To famnela, healing magic is...

00:14:12.200 --> 00:14:14.540
...a powerful attack spell!

00:14:16.620 --> 00:14:21.620
I see! So that explains why
you used the herb on Mineko!

00:14:26.620 --> 00:14:28.830
Now! Everyone, attack!

00:14:30.620 --> 00:14:33.540
Leave it to me!

00:14:33.540 --> 00:14:35.830
Let's try healing magic again!

00:14:37.370 --> 00:14:40.040
Ugh! I'm out of MP!

00:14:42.540 --> 00:14:43.660
Mineko?

00:14:43.660 --> 00:14:46.950
Mineko will be adventurer.

00:14:46.950 --> 00:14:49.250
Together with Makoto.

00:14:52.660 --> 00:14:55.910
And be employee... of Kibou!

00:15:17.620 --> 00:15:21.830
Wh-What happened?
Her tiara fell off and that's it?

00:15:21.830 --> 00:15:24.830
That must be the proof of the queen.

00:15:24.830 --> 00:15:27.910
The shock of losing it made her panic.

00:15:27.910 --> 00:15:31.950
You've gotta be pretty weak-minded
to let that wipe you out.

00:15:31.950 --> 00:15:36.370
Caring too much about status
and power is proof of the weak.

00:15:49.500 --> 00:15:54.410
That was pretty impressive!
You're already pulling your weight!

00:15:54.410 --> 00:15:56.580
We've got a new promising ace, huh?

00:15:58.290 --> 00:15:59.290
Yeah...

00:16:00.910 --> 00:16:02.750
Isn't this great, Mineko?!

00:16:02.750 --> 00:16:03.750
Yeah!

00:16:11.250 --> 00:16:14.410
Hmm? What? What's up?

00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:15.750
Something happen?

00:16:18.950 --> 00:16:23.250
I dunno what's going on,
but now I can get back to the others.

00:16:30.660 --> 00:16:32.330
Uh... Huh?

00:16:35.660 --> 00:16:39.000
Hey, stop it! What's going on?!

00:16:39.000 --> 00:16:42.410
Cut it out! What the hell?!

00:16:42.410 --> 00:16:46.160
That's enough! Stop it!

00:16:54.080 --> 00:16:58.200
Great! I guess we're done here!
Shall we head back?

00:16:58.200 --> 00:17:01.830
Sounds good. And now there's one more of us.

00:17:01.830 --> 00:17:03.160
Let's go, Mineko.

00:17:03.160 --> 00:17:04.160
Okay.

00:17:05.040 --> 00:17:06.330
Um, President?

00:17:06.330 --> 00:17:07.330
Hmm?

00:17:08.250 --> 00:17:09.870
Do you have a minute?

00:17:18.660 --> 00:17:20.000
President...

00:17:20.000 --> 00:17:27.000
You didn't forget our goal is to gather
kirakuri and find the old man, right?

00:17:27.000 --> 00:17:30.750
Of course not. It was my idea.

00:17:30.750 --> 00:17:33.910
As long as you haven't forgot.

00:17:33.910 --> 00:17:38.830
Right now, our company's financial
state isn't exactly the best.

00:17:38.830 --> 00:17:41.540
Yeah, I know that too.

00:17:41.540 --> 00:17:44.910
As long as you understand.

00:17:44.910 --> 00:17:49.330
But the thing is, if we keep
adding new employees...

00:17:49.330 --> 00:17:55.370
True... I'm a bit worried about paying wages,
but I couldn't help it this time.

00:17:55.370 --> 00:17:57.620
I know you couldn't help it.

00:17:57.620 --> 00:18:01.910
That's exactly why I felt like
I had to say something.

00:18:05.830 --> 00:18:07.000
Whoa!

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:09.120
Wh-What's up, Mineko?!

00:18:09.120 --> 00:18:11.660
Can we help you with something?

00:18:11.660 --> 00:18:14.500
You need money?

00:18:14.500 --> 00:18:15.500
Huh?

00:18:15.500 --> 00:18:17.500
I heard talking.

00:18:17.500 --> 00:18:20.540
Oh! Well, that's...!

00:18:20.540 --> 00:18:24.660
That's a famnela for you. Sharp ears.

00:18:24.660 --> 00:18:27.700
In that case, I have good thing.

00:18:27.700 --> 00:18:28.950
This way.

00:18:40.080 --> 00:18:42.120
Mineko, where are we going?

00:18:42.120 --> 00:18:44.410
Just follow. This way.

00:18:44.410 --> 00:18:46.290
You're not gonna eat us, are you?

00:18:46.290 --> 00:18:47.290
Shush!

00:18:49.620 --> 00:18:51.410
Take light away.

00:18:51.410 --> 00:18:53.660
You sure? It'll be dark.

00:18:53.660 --> 00:18:55.450
It's okay.

00:18:55.450 --> 00:18:56.750
Fine then.

00:19:02.580 --> 00:19:04.830
Hmm? What the--?

00:19:06.290 --> 00:19:08.160
What's that light?

00:19:08.160 --> 00:19:09.160
Come.

00:19:21.750 --> 00:19:23.160
Whoa!

00:19:23.160 --> 00:19:24.330
This is...!

00:19:24.330 --> 00:19:25.410
Incredible!

00:19:31.500 --> 00:19:33.410
It looks like space!

00:19:38.910 --> 00:19:41.950
There's so much rare-earth here!

00:19:41.950 --> 00:19:44.790
Look at all the kirakuri too!

00:19:44.790 --> 00:19:47.330
Mineko gathered it.

00:19:47.330 --> 00:19:50.160
Because shinies are pretty.

00:19:51.870 --> 00:19:55.200
I guess she's still got some famnela in her.

00:19:58.750 --> 00:20:04.790
When I alone, to see this makes happy.

00:20:05.450 --> 00:20:10.080
Even when bullied, I can endure.

00:20:10.080 --> 00:20:15.540
The light of shinies comfort me.

00:20:15.540 --> 00:20:16.540
But...

00:20:22.120 --> 00:20:26.080
I don't need now.

00:20:26.080 --> 00:20:30.950
Mineko not alone anymore.

00:20:30.950 --> 00:20:32.250
Mineko!

00:20:39.910 --> 00:20:42.660
I give all to you.

00:20:42.660 --> 00:20:44.450
A-Are you sure?

00:20:44.450 --> 00:20:45.410
Yeah.

00:20:45.410 --> 00:20:48.580
Th-This is an insane amount of kirakuri!

00:20:48.580 --> 00:20:52.330
It's like half of what we need
to call the goddess!

00:20:52.330 --> 00:20:53.450
Really?!

00:20:53.450 --> 00:20:55.620
Isn't that great, President?!

00:20:55.620 --> 00:20:58.620
Yup! It's all thanks to Makoto and Mineko!

00:20:58.620 --> 00:21:01.580
No way! I didn't do anything!

00:21:01.580 --> 00:21:07.250
Wrong. Your kindness towards Mineko
became this wonderful treasure!

00:21:10.080 --> 00:21:12.290
Makoto. Thank you.

00:21:12.290 --> 00:21:13.290
Hmm?

00:21:15.580 --> 00:21:19.290
A crystal flower?! Don't tell me, that's...!

00:21:26.160 --> 00:21:28.700
Is it the one I tried to take?

00:21:28.700 --> 00:21:32.950
I found by accident. I give to Makoto.

00:21:35.410 --> 00:21:38.000
Thanks, Mineko!

00:21:38.000 --> 00:21:39.000
Yeah!

00:21:44.160 --> 00:21:47.870
You think we can afford to hire Mineko now?

00:21:47.870 --> 00:21:53.040
We sure can! I've got high hopes
for Mineko, our trusty new rookie!

00:21:53.040 --> 00:21:55.580
Whoa... What a change of heart.

00:22:08.000 --> 00:22:11.370
Argh! Would you cut it out?!

00:22:11.370 --> 00:22:14.910
Quit it, jerk! I said I'm not your leader!

00:22:16.660 --> 00:22:19.290
Mama!

00:22:38.830 --> 00:22:43.250
<i>Looking way up into the night sky</i>

00:22:43.250 --> 00:22:47.870
<i>A pretty jewel caught my eye</i>

00:22:47.870 --> 00:22:52.200
<i>Clear skies tomorrow sure would be nice</i>

00:22:52.200 --> 00:22:56.330
<i>Now, make a wish upon a star</i>

00:22:56.330 --> 00:22:58.410
<i>Lazily</i>

00:22:58.410 --> 00:23:01.250
<i>Today comes to a close</i>

00:23:01.250 --> 00:23:05.620
<i>Dead tired and worn out</i>

00:23:05.620 --> 00:23:12.120
<i>Good work</i>
<i>Let's do our best again tomorrow</i>

00:23:12.120 --> 00:23:14.700
<i>Goodnight</i>

00:23:14.700 --> 00:23:16.870
<i>Every day is sparkling</i>

00:23:16.870 --> 00:23:21.410
<i>Just like a box of jewels (sparkling)</i>

00:23:21.410 --> 00:23:23.620
<i>And so brilliant</i>

00:23:23.620 --> 00:23:25.830
<i>Any work undone</i>

00:23:25.830 --> 00:23:30.410
<i>We'll leave for dreamland (sleep tight)</i>

00:23:30.410 --> 00:23:33.910
<i>Let's embark on adventure</i>

00:23:33.910 --> 00:23:38.200
<i>So sleep soundly tonight</i>

00:23:38.200 --> 00:23:43.450
<i>And meet up with me in our dreams</i>

00:23:43.450 --> 00:23:46.540
<i>Sleep tight</i>
